<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <.head title="Robin (aka axcelott)" root {assigns} />

    <!-- IndieWeb compatibility -->
    <link rel="webmention" href="//api.geheimesite.nl/webmentions">
    <link rel="pingback" href="//api.geheimesite.nl/pingback">
    <link rel="authorization_endpoint" href="//nym.dupunkto.org" />
    <link rel="token_endpoint" href="//tokens.indieauth.com/token" />

    <!-- RSS, because it's amazing -->
    <link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="lil notes (RSS)" href="//geheimesite.nl/index.xml">
    <link rel="alternate" type="application/atom+xml" title="lil notes (Atom)" href="//geheimesite.nl/atom.xml">
    <link rel="alternate" type="application/feed+json" title="lil notes (JSON)" href="//geheimesite.nl/feed.json">

    <!-- Elsewhere on the Web: -->
    <link rel="me" href="//dupunkto.org/~axcelott" />
    <link rel="me" href="//git.dupunkto.org/~axcelott" />
    <link rel="me" href="//github.com/RobinBoers" />
    <link rel="me" href="//codeberg.org/RobinBoers" />
    <link rel="me" href="//linkedin.com/in/robin-boers" />
    <link rel="me" href="//instagram.com/oblivxi0us" />
    <link rel="me" href="//snapchat.com/@oblivxi0us" />

    <!-- Homepage-specific CSS (might be dirty, but hey! it works :) -->
    <style>
      h2 {
        border: none;
        padding: 0;
        font-size: 1.1em;
      }
      
      .p-family-name::after {
        content: ".";
      }

      body {
        padding: 7px;
      }

      body > main {
        max-width: 52ch;
      }

      @media (min-width: 500px) {
        /* Only show jump link to bottom of screen on mobile & unstyled */
        body p.jump {
          display: none;
        }

        body {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: 20ch 52ch;
          gap: 2em;
          margin: initial;
        }

        body > main {
          grid-row: 1;
          grid-column: 2;
        }

        body > nav {
          margin-top: -0.1em;
          grid-row: 1;
          grid-column: 1;
          text-align: right;
        }

        body > main > p:first-child,
        body > nav h3:first-of-type {
          margin-top: 40px;
        }

        body > footer {
          grid-column: 2;
        }

        body > nav summary {
          display: none;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 500px) {
        /* Make "Menu" label look like heading */
        body > nav summary h2 {
          display: inline;
        }
        body > nav summary::marker {
          font-size: 0;
        }
      }

      ul {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      body > nav a {
        text-transform: lowercase;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      body > footer small {
        font-family: sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8em;
        filter: grayscale();
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class="h-card">
    <p class="jump"><a href="#menu">Menu 🞃</a></p>

    <main>
      <p>
        hii, i'm <span class="p-name"><span class="p-given-name">Robin</span> <span class="p-family-name" hidden>Boers</span></span> (<span class="p-pronouns">he/him</span>). <span class="p-note">i write code and break things.</span>
      </p>

      <p>I'm (already) <%= @now.year - 2007 - if({@now.month, @now.day} < {1, 13}, do: 1, else: 0) %>yo. I study Educational Sciences at Utrecht University, and live in <span class="p-locality">Maassluis</span>, the
        <span class="p-country-name">Netherlands</span>.</p>

      <p>
        this website is running from november, a cute black box in the corner of my bedroom. <a href="/stability">website stability note</a>
      </p>

      <p>I love programming, reading, writing and biking.</p>

      <!--
      <p>
        i somewhat regularly post <em>things</em> on
        <a href="/blog">my blog</a>. ('Somewhat regularly' meaning:
        around once a year, if I feel like it.)
      </p>-->

      <p>
        I co-founded <a href="//dupunkto.org">:du:punkto</a>. We write software and publish
        it in the public domain.
      </p>

      <p>I'm also a frontend designer and developer working at
        <span class="p-org h-card">
          <a class="p-name u-url" href="//qdentity.nl" hreflang="nl">Qdentity</a>
        </span> and <span class="p-org h-card"><a class="p-name u-url" href="//maakotheek.nl" hreflang="nl">Maakotheek</a></span>.</p>

      <p>You can hire me at my own webdesign studio, <a href="//11networks.nl">11networks</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        i'm a cat person. love you <a href="//instagram.com/coconootje23">Coco</a>.
      </p>
      

